-[metaljax](https://github.com/eterevsky/metaljax) for AlphaFold design and
+[FreeBindCraft's frozen MetalJAX build](https://github.com/cytokineking/metaljax/releases/tag/v0.11.9-fbc1) for AlphaFold design and
